      "description": "Start date: 2026-08-31\nPosted: Posted 9 Days Ago\nPart time\n\n[What the role is] School of Business - Associate Lecturer (Human Resource) [What you will be working on] Facilitate learning for both Pre-Employment Training (PET) and Continuing Education & Training (CET) learners through interactive seminar, workshop, coaching, and experiential learning activities.  •    Design, review and deliver industry-relevant curriculum in areas such as:           Full HR functions         -     HR Analytics & HR Technology (AI)         -     Strategic and Operational HR Functions          -     Industrial & Organisational Psychology          -     Positive Psychology          -     Psychometric Assessment          -     Socio-emotional Counselling  [What we are looking for] •        Relevant qualifications preferably in the relevant field(s) •        Preferably with at least 5 years of relevant industry experience  •        Able to commit at least 2 days per week to facilitate.  •        Be a Singapore Citizen or Singapore Permanent Resident  •        Preferably possess own laptop with minimum Microsoft Office installed"
