plement and administer module delivery, related activities (including student assessments and assignments) to meet learning outcomes.  [What we are looking for] Applicants should have a relevant qualification in IT / Computer Science, with a minimum of 1 year industry experience. Applicants with business development or pre-sales consulting experience is preferred. Applicants should be proficient in any two or more of the following areas:  •    Programming languages such as Python and/or Java. •    Development of mobile and web applications and software testing. •    Containerization platforms and/or cloud deployment technologies. •    IT Audit and Compliance, Personal Data Protection. •    IT Project Management / IT Product Management. •    Penetration Testing / Digital Forensics. •    TensorFlow/PyTorch, DeepSpeed/Megatron-LM. LLM frameworks"
